    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require all new cars sold in the UK to be fitted with dashcams",
        "additional_details": "Making it a legal requirement for new cars to have dash cameras fitted in the front and back of the vehicle and working at all times could result in less ambiguity regarding whose responsibility it was for an accident, and it could give insurers an idea of the insurance risk that their customers if their accident history is recorded.",
        "background": "Make it a law that requires all new cars sold in the UK to be factory fitted with back and front dash cameras.",
